{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221460","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322146001:1":{"text":"저기, 혹시 최근에 성기사가 시더 마을에 온 적이 있나요?","source_cn":"这位先生，请问最近是有圣骑士前来雪松镇吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410F5EF61BEBA1EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322146002:1":{"text":"아, 맞아요! 어제 오셨는데, 이름이... 아, 테미히아라고 했어요. 커다란 말을 타신 모습이 정말 멋지더라고요!","source_cn":"啊，是的是的！昨天来的，是位叫……呃，对了，名叫特弥希...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87DC0850BBB49EDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322146003:1":{"text":"테미히아라니! 분명 화이트마운틴 수도원의 성직자들을 도와 이번일을 처리하러 온 걸 거예요.","source_cn":"竟然是特弥希娅！她一定是来协助白山修道院的圣职者们处理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E3647A561BE84CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322146004:1":{"text":"근데 성기사님께서 그러시더라고요. 화이트마운틴의 살아있는 시체들은 악마의 부하가 아니라 과거에 악마와 싸운 전사들이래요!","source_cn":"也不知道怎么回事，圣骑士大人说咱们白山的那些活死人不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F7BC5BC087177F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322146005:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여! 정말일까요? 너무 혼란스러워요...","source_cn":"艾雅在上，这到底是真的还是假的？！真是把我给弄糊涂了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1489D3E230588EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322146006:1":{"text":"에휴, 됐어요. 설마 성기사님께서 거짓말을 하셨을 리는 없을 테니까요.","source_cn":"唉，算了，不想了，反正圣骑士大人是不会欺骗我们的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAAFCD97DA14DE40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔德乌兹":{"text":"타데우스","source":"塔德乌兹","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}